.terraform

# .terraform.lock.hcl is deliberately NOT ignored. It pins the exact provider
# versions and their checksums, so `terraform init` resolves identically for
# everyone and in CI. Ignoring it is the infrastructure equivalent of ignoring
# uv.lock — the next `init` can quietly pick up a new provider major.
!.terraform.lock.hcl

